{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38212","headline":"别绪 · 韩偓","name":"别绪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别绪静愔愔，牵愁暗入心。\n已回花渚櫂，悔听酒垆琴。\n菊露凄罗幕，棃霜恻锦衾。\n此生终独宿，到死誓相寻。\n月好知何计，歌阑叹不禁。\n山巅更高处，忆上上头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}